    <p><STRONG><I>Streptomyces</I> <I>marokkonensis</I></STRONG> AP1 is an aerobe, Gram-positive bacterium that builds an aerial mycelium and was isolated from rhizosphere soil of <i>Argania spinosa</i> L..</p>

